    \"<span class=sf-dump-key>instructions</span>\" => \"<span class=sf-dump-str title=\"1738 characters\">{&quot;ops&quot;:[{&quot;insert&quot;:&quot;(i). The fee should be paid by means of Demand Draft obtained from any scheduled Bank or Co-operative Bank drawn in favour of the Secretary, Electrical Licensing Board, Chennai &#8211; 600 032. Payable at Chennai. Remittance by any other method will not be accepted.&quot;},{&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;list&quot;:&quot;ordered&quot;},&quot;insert&quot;:&quot;\\n&quot;},{&quot;insert&quot;:&quot;The application and the photo affixed therein should be got attested by the employer. and the same should be sent through proper channel.&quot;},{&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;list&quot;:&quot;ordered&quot;},&quot;insert&quot;:&quot;\\n&quot;},{&quot;insert&quot;:&quot;The applicant should be a Diploma / Degree holder in Electrical or Mechanical Engineering. An attested copy of the relevant certificate to be enclosed.&quot;},{&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;list&quot;:&quot;ordered&quot;},&quot;insert&quot;:&quot;\\n&quot;},{&quot;insert&quot;:&quot;Certificates issued by the training Institutes recognized by the Central Electricity Authority for this purpose should be sent. (Original Certificate along with attested xerox copy should be enclosed. Xerox copy without attestation by a Gazetted Officer or by the employer will not be accepted.)&quot;},{&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;list&quot;:&quot;ordered&quot;},&quot;insert&quot;:&quot;\\n&quot;},{&quot;insert&quot;:&quot;Two copies of Passport size photograph of the applicant (6cm x 4 cm) (taken not earlier than three months from the date of application) should be sent.&quot;},{&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;list&quot;:&quot;ordered&quot;},&quot;insert&quot;:&quot;\\n&quot;},{&quot;insert&quot;:&quot;Applicant&#039;s signature in triplicate on a separate sheet of paper should be sent.&quot;},{&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;list&quot;:&quot;ordered&quot;},&quot;insert&quot;:&quot;\\n